numpy only — no third-party model code) on the MNIST dataset (derived from NIST
Special Database 19; MNIST is commonly distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0 — attribution:
Yann LeCun, Corinna Cortes, Christopher J.C. Burges, "THE MNIST DATABASE of
handwritten digits"). The inference code (web2/src/core/digitnet.ts) is MIT as above.
